    <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of theme directory files — 2 section keys. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Top-level registry. CRTP-derived from <ref refid="classjam_1_1Bimap" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Bimap</ref>&lt;<ref refid="structconfig_1_1_themes" kindref="compound">Themes</ref>&gt;.</para>
<para>Maps each enum key to its Identifier stem and resolves the on-disk filename via <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_themes_1a48be35feb4087a7891dd6a41a8674f18" kindref="member">getName()</ref>. All keys produce &quot;stem.lua&quot;.</para>
<para>Owns the themes root directory path (seeded from <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_file_1a8fb7a80701aaed8671256aa65afaf19d" kindref="member">File::getPath</ref>). The live instance is owned by <ref refid="classend_1_1_application" kindref="compound">end::Application</ref> — static <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_themes_1a75ef807eb5feb2ef9c9af61a265f21b7" kindref="member">get()</ref> resolves through <ref refid="structjam_1_1Instance" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Instance</ref>&lt;<ref refid="structconfig_1_1_themes" kindref="compound">Themes</ref>&gt;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
